WEBVTT

00:03.030 --> 00:04.620
You, too.

00:05.500 --> 00:09.670
You're being played with by the Onikirimaru.

00:10.440 --> 00:12.930
It's all the Tamayori princess' doing.

00:14.010 --> 00:17.810
Shut up. I'm here of my own will.

00:18.310 --> 00:19.910
It has nothing to do with you!

00:21.720 --> 00:24.990
Then do something about it. If you can.

00:24.990 --> 00:26.150
I will.

00:27.990 --> 00:30.490
I'll definitely do something.

00:30.490 --> 00:31.520
I won't let anyone...

00:31.860 --> 00:34.660
I won't let a single person suffer misfortune.

00:56.050 --> 00:58.050
When did I first notice

00:58.050 --> 01:00.060
That your fingers were

01:00.060 --> 01:03.720
So beautiful

01:04.030 --> 01:07.720
And when did I notice this feeling?

01:08.060 --> 01:11.030
So fast that I'll be run over

01:11.030 --> 01:13.670
I cannot keep up

01:13.670 --> 01:17.010
My fearful heart

01:17.010 --> 01:19.740
Puts on the brakes

01:20.180 --> 01:22.540
Our eyes meet

01:23.410 --> 01:24.550
We talk about something

01:24.550 --> 01:27.740
When you look at me

01:28.050 --> 01:32.490
I cannot move

01:34.090 --> 01:41.760
My beating heart is about to break

01:42.060 --> 01:46.030
The arms that catch me pull me

01:46.030 --> 01:50.070
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

01:50.070 --> 01:54.740
That I like you

01:55.080 --> 01:58.050
So much it hurts

01:58.050 --> 02:05.750
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

02:18.430 --> 02:20.770
Takuma! Are you all right?

02:21.940 --> 02:23.700
How shameful.

02:29.140 --> 02:30.310
Come on out.

02:30.310 --> 02:32.410
If you don't, I won't hold back.

02:32.410 --> 02:33.940
W-Wait!

02:36.480 --> 02:38.490
K-Kiyono?

02:37.250 --> 02:41.210
The Eternal

02:37.250 --> 02:41.210
Promise

02:39.750 --> 02:41.190
Hello.

02:41.460 --> 02:43.320
But more importantly!

02:43.930 --> 02:46.490
That kick would have sent me flying!

02:46.490 --> 02:48.830
What are you trying to do to a girl?!

02:49.160 --> 02:50.830
Girl?

02:51.270 --> 02:52.470
Man, he pisses me off!

02:52.470 --> 02:55.340
Did you see his mocking face just now?

02:55.340 --> 03:00.180
Maybe I can't be called a "girl" anymore at the age of twenty-three, but...

03:00.180 --> 03:01.910
Twenty-three?

03:05.880 --> 03:08.350
Osaki fox, you're so cute!

03:09.020 --> 03:10.280
You can see him?

03:13.690 --> 03:17.130
A-Actually, I'm... uh...

03:18.530 --> 03:20.360
I'll tell you.

03:20.360 --> 03:22.130
That's why I came here.

03:22.830 --> 03:25.200
My name is Kiyono Takara.

03:25.700 --> 03:27.640
That's true, but...

03:28.540 --> 03:31.140
I'm really twenty-three.

03:31.140 --> 03:34.840
I infiltrated Koryo Academy as a Bureau employee.

03:36.480 --> 03:38.880
Then you're not Ashiya's...

03:38.880 --> 03:42.150
He's not my uncle, he's my boss.

03:42.150 --> 03:45.320
Ryo Kutani is working with the Bureau.

03:45.320 --> 03:48.620
Or rather, Ashiya was using him...

03:49.190 --> 03:52.460
I helped the Bureau.

03:52.930 --> 03:54.520
Don't get it wrong.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.530
Don't get mad.

03:56.530 --> 04:00.000
So, you're here on Ashiya's order.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.530
I haven't told Ashiya.

04:02.170 --> 04:03.830
As if I'd believe that!

04:04.110 --> 04:05.800
Takuma, wait.

04:06.370 --> 04:10.070
Why? Why are you helping us?

04:11.680 --> 04:14.550
You might not believe me, but...

04:15.380 --> 04:18.880
I think this is the wrong way to do it.

04:19.790 --> 04:23.820
Peace gained through the sacrifice of someone else definitely isn't right!

04:25.590 --> 04:28.960
And, Tamaki, I think of you as a friend.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.430
So I want to help you!

04:31.100 --> 04:32.570
Please believe me!

04:40.070 --> 04:42.340
I understand. Thank you.

04:43.380 --> 04:44.440
Tamaki...

04:45.080 --> 04:46.280
Are you all right with this?

04:46.280 --> 04:50.410
Yes. I'll trust Kiyono.

04:51.120 --> 04:54.350
I don't think she's lying.

04:58.130 --> 04:59.430
I understand.

04:59.430 --> 05:02.360
I'll trust whomever you trust.

05:04.930 --> 05:06.100
Takuma!

05:06.100 --> 05:07.440
Hey, Kiyono.

05:07.440 --> 05:09.470
If you know something, tell me.

05:09.470 --> 05:12.470
I want to let Takuma rest a little,

05:12.470 --> 05:14.640
but the village is full of Ashiya's traps,

05:14.640 --> 05:17.270
and the forest is full of gods controlled by Grandma.

05:19.580 --> 05:22.410
I think it's probably impossible to leave the village.

05:22.750 --> 05:26.950
But you should still be able to hide in the school for a night.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.660
But...

05:30.660 --> 05:33.630
That's as much as I can tell you.

05:34.260 --> 05:36.230
That's okay. Thank you, Kiyono.

05:37.670 --> 05:40.130
Kiyono, you're a valuable friend to me.

05:40.130 --> 05:43.810
If Takuma and I escape safely,

05:43.810 --> 05:46.440
let's meet again then.

05:46.440 --> 05:49.570
Yeah. I'm sorry for lying to you up until now.

05:52.810 --> 05:54.180
Let's go, Takuma.

05:54.480 --> 05:55.420
Yeah.

06:00.150 --> 06:02.620
Do your best, Tamaki.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.960
If we don't go back soon,
Ashiya will notice.

06:07.700 --> 06:09.960
I know. What about you?

06:10.630 --> 06:13.030
I'm not the Bureau's dog.

06:14.840 --> 06:16.330
A dog, huh?

06:17.340 --> 06:20.970
You really know how to hit someone where it hurts.

06:28.780 --> 06:29.940
Does it hurt?

06:30.520 --> 06:31.650
No...

06:43.700 --> 06:45.000
It's so...

06:46.070 --> 06:47.500
Are you scared?

06:48.270 --> 06:49.430
No.

06:53.780 --> 06:55.800
I'm glad you're here, Takuma.

06:56.710 --> 06:59.980
It's my fault it turned out like this, isn't it?

07:00.620 --> 07:05.750
You withstood all those painful feelings and stayed by my side, didn't you?

07:16.200 --> 07:19.030
<i>Up until now, I've sought power.</i>

07:19.930 --> 07:23.200
<i>And now, you've surpassed humanity.</i>

07:23.200 --> 07:27.510
<i>I sense that you're about to obtain power that rivals demons and gods.</i>

07:28.140 --> 07:31.810
<i>I want to test your power,</i>

07:31.810 --> 07:38.850
<i>and whether my power can overturn god and fate.</i>

07:42.460 --> 07:44.190
Hurry and become a demon,

07:44.990 --> 07:47.190
even just one minute sooner.

08:06.810 --> 08:07.800
<i>Eins...</i>

08:11.650 --> 08:12.810
Monado,

08:13.690 --> 08:17.250
I will not lose to both the gods and fate twice.

08:18.160 --> 08:20.630
And I will protect you.

08:21.200 --> 08:23.760
This time... definitely.

08:32.370 --> 08:33.610
What's funny?

08:33.610 --> 08:38.100
It seems Eins is starting to act according to his own theory.

08:39.210 --> 08:44.310
Zwei, you want to eat your fill soon, don't you?

08:44.950 --> 08:46.050
Of souls...

08:47.320 --> 08:50.520
I plan to prepare the best timing.

08:50.830 --> 08:55.850
Until then, by all means, work with me.

09:17.490 --> 09:20.280
I hope there's something to eat here...

09:36.740 --> 09:37.770
<i>Who's there?</i>

09:37.770 --> 09:41.000
<i>It doesn't matter who, just leave! Hurry!</i>

09:49.020 --> 09:50.040
Tamaki?

09:54.120 --> 09:55.180
Everyone...

09:55.590 --> 09:57.430
I'm glad you're safe.

09:57.430 --> 09:58.950
Is Takuma okay?

09:59.530 --> 10:02.220
Takuma is resting over there.

10:02.960 --> 10:03.860
Wait.

10:05.770 --> 10:07.670
Talk to us first.

10:08.400 --> 10:10.030
What's going on with Takuma?

10:10.940 --> 10:12.100
Going on?

10:13.810 --> 10:16.070
Stop it. Don't touch her!

10:17.210 --> 10:19.240
Wait, Takuma! Look.

10:21.720 --> 10:24.280
Senpai... Shinji...

10:28.620 --> 10:31.290
Senpai... Shinji...

10:32.160 --> 10:35.390
Did you come after us on Lady Baba's orders?

10:36.130 --> 10:39.300
We heard that you had started to become a monster.

10:39.300 --> 10:43.140
For your sake, too, Takuma, we have to kill you.

10:46.110 --> 10:46.940
Wait!

10:46.940 --> 10:47.780
You're wrong!

10:47.780 --> 10:48.480
Tamaki!

10:48.480 --> 10:49.580
Believe me.

10:49.580 --> 10:51.810
Takuma won't become a monster.

10:51.810 --> 10:53.470
I had a dream.

10:54.350 --> 10:57.450
In the dream, I was the Tamayori princess,

10:57.450 --> 10:59.320
and Takuma was the Underworld god.

10:59.790 --> 11:02.190
He wasn't the demon from a thousand years ago.

11:02.190 --> 11:03.380
What?

11:04.160 --> 11:08.120
That dream is a distant memory passed down to me through my blood.

11:08.530 --> 11:10.960
It's the truth that was forgotten.

11:12.970 --> 11:16.960
And Takuma is fiercely fighting his pain.

11:17.670 --> 11:19.640
Takuma will definitely...

11:20.510 --> 11:22.670
not lose to the Onikirimaru's power.

11:28.120 --> 11:30.240
Please believe me.

11:36.990 --> 11:39.360
It's just as I thought.

11:39.890 --> 11:41.130
Yeah.

11:41.130 --> 11:42.260
Yes.

11:43.860 --> 11:48.700
It's true that we came looking for you on Lady Baba's orders.

11:50.000 --> 11:54.510
And if Takuma was poisoned by the sword and turning into a monster,

11:54.510 --> 11:58.070
ending his life would be our duty.

11:58.980 --> 12:02.580
However, if you hadn't lost to the Onikirimaru's power,

12:02.580 --> 12:05.250
and you two hadn't lost hope,

12:05.590 --> 12:09.420
we planned to do anything to help you escape.

12:09.890 --> 12:15.300
And we believed that you would not lose hope.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.060
Then...

12:17.700 --> 12:22.000
Whether Takuma is a monster or an
Underworld god, it doesn't matter.

12:22.600 --> 12:26.040
We believe the two people in front of us.

12:26.040 --> 12:27.470
The past doesn't matter.

12:28.040 --> 12:29.670
Right? Isn't that right?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.250
Yes.

12:31.250 --> 12:33.850
You are the same Takuma and
Tamaki you've always been,

12:33.850 --> 12:36.120
just as we knew you'd be.

12:36.120 --> 12:38.380
Yes. I think so, too.

12:39.450 --> 12:40.650
Everyone...

12:43.320 --> 12:44.820
Thank you very much.

12:45.630 --> 12:49.090
We're going to Logos to steal back the Artifacts.

12:49.560 --> 12:54.000
If we can get them back, I think there's still a chance we can create the seal.

12:54.570 --> 12:57.060
Please try to hold out until then.

12:57.540 --> 13:00.270
I know the story of the Underworld god.

13:00.810 --> 13:05.150
Long before our ancestors, the Tamayori princess

13:05.150 --> 13:09.280
most likely sealed the Onikirimaru's power inside the Underworld god.

13:09.720 --> 13:12.350
Then it's all right, I'm sure it's fine.

13:12.620 --> 13:13.610
Yes.

13:15.090 --> 13:16.890
Lady Baba is serious.

13:16.890 --> 13:18.930
Listen, there's no time.

13:18.930 --> 13:21.920
Once you've rested, run before dawn breaks.

13:22.560 --> 13:26.090
This is some food I prepared for a time like this.

13:27.840 --> 13:29.430
Thank you, everyone.

13:30.100 --> 13:31.400
All right. Let's hurry.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.270
Yeah.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.300
Yes.

13:44.450 --> 13:46.040
Keep Tamaki safe.

13:51.590 --> 13:52.620
Got it.

14:00.800 --> 14:03.290
We don't have time to wait for Ohmi.

14:04.040 --> 14:07.300
We'll just have to do all we can do.

14:08.110 --> 14:10.300
Let's hurry to Logos' hideout.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.850
I'll go, too.

14:16.220 --> 14:17.010
You're...

14:17.550 --> 14:19.190
What do you want?

14:19.190 --> 14:23.390
I don't know who you are, but if you're not involved, please stay out of this.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.820
Not involved?

14:26.890 --> 14:31.260
If told you I was the true Inukai guardian, would you be satisfied?

14:33.870 --> 14:36.870
You're the true Inukai...

14:36.870 --> 14:40.670
Yeah. The Inukai tried to save you, kid,

14:40.670 --> 14:45.550
from the curse, so they made it seem like you were a Kutani child,

14:45.550 --> 14:49.950
by borrowing the power of the Bureau of Medicine.

14:52.750 --> 14:53.720
I see.

14:54.320 --> 14:56.620
But why now?

14:57.190 --> 14:59.850
Because you guys can't be counted on.

15:01.060 --> 15:03.030
What'd you say?

15:07.700 --> 15:08.790
He's fast.

15:09.570 --> 15:10.470
And one more thing.

15:11.210 --> 15:13.970
Watching them made me want to help.

15:14.710 --> 15:18.300
I want to do something about the Onikirimaru, too.

15:20.710 --> 15:22.210
It doesn't seem like he's lying.

15:23.050 --> 15:24.750
Shinji, you decide.

15:25.750 --> 15:27.720
Whether we accept him or not,

15:27.720 --> 15:31.090
you have the right to decide the fate of the Inukai and the Kotokura.

15:35.300 --> 15:37.990
I have not accepted you yet.

15:39.070 --> 15:42.800
But if you say that your strength is that of a guardian,

15:42.800 --> 15:45.370
then for Tamaki and Takuma,

15:45.370 --> 15:47.030
please fight with us.

15:50.110 --> 15:53.600
I'll lend you my power. For now.

15:54.380 --> 15:55.870
Understood. Very well.

15:56.580 --> 15:58.180
The more allies we have, the better.

15:58.790 --> 16:01.950
Yeah. Now that that's decided, let's hurry.

16:11.730 --> 16:13.390
<i>If I can figure out the trick...</i>

16:14.300 --> 16:18.570
What are you doing in my room?

16:22.280 --> 16:26.300
Snake, I'm looking for an explanation.

16:27.250 --> 16:30.250
Depending on what it is...

16:30.250 --> 16:31.810
I told him to come here.

16:39.590 --> 16:41.360
Show me the Artifacts.

16:42.760 --> 16:46.670
If you had just told me so,

16:47.170 --> 16:50.000
I could have shown you right away.

17:10.560 --> 17:13.360
Please refrain from touching.

17:13.360 --> 17:19.930
This magic might affect even you, Aria.

17:28.610 --> 17:29.300
Oh?

17:30.210 --> 17:35.010
Four incorrigible little mice approach the mansion.

17:35.920 --> 17:38.350
Let's have you go.

17:39.490 --> 17:41.980
You don't mind, do you, Snake?

17:59.170 --> 18:01.670
Vier?! Zwei, stop it!

18:08.650 --> 18:12.680
She really is just a little girl when it comes to physical attacks.

18:15.360 --> 18:16.410
Aria.

18:17.220 --> 18:19.430
I'll leave Vier to you.

18:19.430 --> 18:22.230
She's a hostage to control Aria.

18:22.230 --> 18:23.420
Be courteous.

18:25.600 --> 18:27.100
Really.

18:27.100 --> 18:29.660
What's going on with this forest?

18:30.540 --> 18:31.540
Don't say that.

18:31.540 --> 18:33.510
This is the only way we can meet Ohmi.

18:35.480 --> 18:38.340
It must be inconvenient to have such useless noses.

18:39.910 --> 18:40.900
This way.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.020
Ohmi!

18:58.470 --> 18:59.800
His explanation comes later!

19:00.270 --> 19:01.800
Ohmi, we have no time.

19:01.800 --> 19:03.070
Listen to what we have to say.

19:03.400 --> 19:06.130
As it is, Takuma and
Tamaki won't be saved.

19:07.310 --> 19:10.940
Lady Baba is trying to sacrifice
Tamaki for the Onikirimaru!

19:12.410 --> 19:13.810
Sacrifice?

19:13.810 --> 19:16.680
Yes. In order to stop the
Onikirimaru's rampage,

19:16.680 --> 19:19.880
and reestablish the seal, she said that's the only option.

19:20.620 --> 19:24.890
There's nothing that we alone can do to stop it anymore.

19:25.360 --> 19:28.120
Plus, Onizaki and Tamaki are...

19:28.600 --> 19:31.660
They were cornered and took the Onikirimaru and ran.

19:32.300 --> 19:33.670
We want to help them!

19:34.000 --> 19:35.800
Please, Ohmi!

19:36.140 --> 19:38.770
We want to save Tamaki and Takuma!

19:39.040 --> 19:42.100
We don't want to let them become sacrifices for the Onikirimaru!

19:45.550 --> 19:48.650
I was trying to obtain the Artifacts,

19:48.650 --> 19:50.450
but it looks like I took too long.

19:51.390 --> 19:54.650
There's no postponing this any longer.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.690
Yeah.

19:56.690 --> 19:57.520
Yes!

20:09.800 --> 20:12.530
Monado has been captured by them,

20:12.970 --> 20:16.970
while you were casually taken in by memories of the past.

20:18.650 --> 20:20.750
There's no time to hesitate.

20:20.750 --> 20:25.620
Take down the demon and obtain the Artifact.

20:25.890 --> 20:29.350
It's the only way to save Aria.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.480
Takuma.

20:53.950 --> 20:55.420
You're awake?

20:55.880 --> 20:58.150
Yes. Did you sleep?

20:58.620 --> 21:00.350
Yeah, like a baby.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.220
Ready to go?

21:04.220 --> 21:05.060
Yeah.

21:12.070 --> 21:21.610
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

21:21.610 --> 21:30.380
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

21:30.950 --> 21:36.060
Tell me everything about the dream you had

21:36.060 --> 21:40.490
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

21:40.490 --> 21:45.630
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

21:45.630 --> 21:52.440
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

21:52.440 --> 22:02.020
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

22:02.020 --> 22:11.930
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

22:11.930 --> 22:21.500
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

22:21.500 --> 22:29.980
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

22:29.980 --> 22:35.640
I promise you

22:48.060 --> 22:49.260
He's...

22:52.330 --> 22:55.460
Weren't you going to wait until I became a demon?

22:56.170 --> 22:57.330
Monado...

22:58.640 --> 23:00.470
What did you do with Monado?

23:02.140 --> 23:04.840
Monado? Did something happen to Aria?

23:05.650 --> 23:09.510
Fate, gods, overwhelming power,

23:10.680 --> 23:13.350
have you come before me again?

23:14.550 --> 23:16.790
That which I must protect...

23:17.690 --> 23:19.490
Are you here to steal it?

23:34.610 --> 23:35.970
I like you.

23:38.580 --> 23:40.710
Don't stay by their side anymore.

23:42.080 --> 23:43.680
Stay by mine.

23:48.490 --> 23:53.360
I want to feel your warmth forever.

23:55.230 --> 24:01.000
Next Time: The Power of the Gods
